# Base image for every FROM in infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile: the Docker Official Image python:3.15.2-slim-trixie
# (CPython 3.15.2 on Debian 13), by index digest, the same pin as the website's lab image and the Cloud Crawler AddOn.
# Python 3.15 is the HCW floor, the newest Python line (HCW-HybridCloudWorks issue #1707); this repository moved to it
# from python:3.14.10 on 2026-11-12 and is still moved by hand. The Dockerfile does not read this file:
# it repeats the digest in full on each FROM line, so the two are changed together by hand, and scripts/check-versions.sh
# (run by ci.yml's lint job and `make lint`) fails unless every FROM equals PYTHON_IMAGE@PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST and the tag
# carries PYTHON_VERSION. The tag beside the digest is documentation; Docker resolves the digest.
# Plain shell assignments, read by /bin/sh.
# Resolved on 2026-11-12 from Docker Hub: python:3.15.2-slim-trixie and python:3.15-slim-trixie both pointed at the
# digest below (3.15.2 was the newest 3.15 patch; no 3.15.3 tag existed). To move it, resolve the new digest with
# `docker buildx imagetools inspect python:3.15-slim-trixie`, change this file and both FROM lines of the Dockerfile
# together (a new Python minor version also changes the python3.15 folder names in the Dockerfile), and run
# `bash scripts/scan-image.sh` (the weekly image scan, image-scan.yml, also runs on a pull request that touches this
# folder).
PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.15.2-slim-trixie
PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST=sha256:65a65fc7b30b06cb6df4930fd4650697cb23f4c2698ab81fc87e4b031bc36928
PYTHON_VERSION=3.15.2
